- **U-Mamba Bot** demonstrated strong performance with a Dice score of 83.51 using the same patch size as SwinUNETR V2 and isotropic spacing. This suggests that integrating Mamba modules in the bottleneck can significantly enhance model performance, especially when combined with U-Net architecture.

